# uwuCurrency's environment variables (currency.uwuapps.org). Set them in the Vercel project
# (Settings → Environment Variables, Production ticked, each marked Sensitive), or copy this file
# to .env.local for `vercel dev`. Never commit the real values: .env and .env.* are git-ignored,
# this example aside.
#
# Every one is optional. Without any of them the converter, its history and sharing history
# between devices all work; what each one adds is said above it.

# ---- New versions of the Android app (api/push/release.js; flutter/FIREBASE-SETUP.md) ----
# Without these the site still works, and the app finds new versions itself while it's open.
#
# The Firebase service account's JSON key (the whole file, or base64 of it), with only the
# "Firebase Cloud Messaging API Admin" role: the uwucurrency-push account, step 4 of the guide.
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=
# The secret GitHub signs its release webhook with: a long random string, also in GitHub's
# webhook settings (step 6 of the guide).
GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# A read-only GitHub token, raising GitHub's limit on the release lookups behind
# /api/app-release (60 an hour without one; the answer is cached for ten minutes either way).
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ---- Report a bug (api/bug-report.js, js/bug-report.js, the apps' Report a bug) ----
# The edge tray's Report a bug sends what went wrong as a Telegram message from a bot to one or
# more chats. The bot's token from BotFather (a bot of its own is easiest), and the chats to send
# to, split by commas: a person's chat ID (after they've sent the bot /start), a group's or
# channel's ID (-100…, the bot added to it), a public one's @name, or <chat ID>/<topic ID> for one
# topic of a group with topics. e.g. 424242,-1001234567890,-1001234567890/17
# BUG-REPORT-SETUP.md, at the top of the repo, goes through making the bot and finding each ID.
# Without both, the form says reports can't be sent yet and offers email instead.
BUG_REPORT_BOT_TOKEN=
BUG_REPORT_CHAT_ID=
# Vercel KV or Upstash Redis, for limits that hold across instances (6 reports an hour from one
# IP, 60 from everyone). Without it, only 2 a minute from one IP, per instance.
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
